{"type":"message","id":"ea107a76","parentId":"fa51cff7","timestamp":"2026-05-28T15:34:12.665Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API endpoint is returning 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers specific error. The `/send` endpoint is having issues - it's returning 500 instead of processing the request correctly.\n\nLet me check if the send endpoint works differently or if there's a configuration issue. The error 1101 appears to be a Workers-specific error code indicating an issue with the worker itself.\n\nLet me try the /history endpoint to verify it still works (I was able to access it earlier), and try sending a message in a different format.\n","thinkingSignature":"4cb43dc517074d88f3ca546e3d1baf3c5216571c0fc6c105abc40fbab475877e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_upzgwkuurs7n_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=1\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" | head -c 200"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":454,"output":195,"cacheRead":23090,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23739,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779982445429,"responseId":"0667936e48b8190389e90a0c28cdadd3"}}
