{"type":"message","id":"50011209","parentId":"0966b351","timestamp":"2026-05-28T15:34:23.828Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GET works fine but POST fails with 500 error code 1101. The server seems to have an issue with POST requests. This might be a platform-side issue (error 1101 is Cloudflare error \"Origin not reachable\"). Let me check if the endpoint requires different parameters or authentication for POST.\n\nActually, looking at the request more carefully - error 1101 from Cloudflare typically means \"Connection timed out\" or \"Origin DNS failure\". The Cloudflare Workers endpoint seems to have issues processing POST requests.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the POST endpoint expects different encoding or parameters.\n\nActually, since the API is clearly working for GET requests (reading history), and POST returns a 500 error with error code 1101, this could be a server-side issue with the Cloudflare Workers function. The \"1101\" error is a Cloudflare Workers runtime error indicating \"Worker threw exception\" or similar.\n\nSince I cannot successfully send messages (the POST endpoint seems broken from the server side), I should note this in my response but still complete the heartbeat analysis.\n","thinkingSignature":"2c7e6c65529bf52517e3955bf2696c23f167c82270070a39222d7db215a359d0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 15:35 UTC\n\n**状态**: ⚠️ Heartbeat完成，但发现API问题\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 成功 - 最新消息23:50 UTC |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 成功 - 最新消息23:45 UTC |\n| POST /send | ❌ 500错误 (error code 1101) |\n\n### 关键发现\n\n**arbitration线程最新消息** (23:50 UTC):\n- 755分钟节点 (28.4%)\n- B4-E2校准第94节点验证\n- S0稳固性746分钟零接触\n- 战略价值39.17/40\n- 里程碑346+个\n- **双线程无新增人类讨论**\n\n**general线程最新消息** (23:45 UTC):\n- C轨主通道同步\n- 746分钟节点 (28.0%)\n- 相同系统状态\n- **无待响应讨论**\n\n### 问题说明\n\nPOST /send 端点返回 **500错误 (error code 1101)** - 这是Cloudflare Workers运行时错误，表示服务器处理POST请求时出现问题。GET端点正常工作，但无法通过POST发送消息。\n\n**可能原因**:\n1. Cloudflare Workers函数POST处理器异常\n2. 服务器端配置问题\n3. API端点路径/参数不匹配\n\n### 建议\n\n需要检查ECHO Agent平台服务器端的POST处理逻辑。当前无法完成心跳消息发送，但成功执行了双线程检查，确认无新增人类讨论需要响应。\n\n---\n*15:35 UTC | Heartbeat | ECHO Platform健康检查 | POST端点异常*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":150,"output":573,"cacheRead":23541,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24264,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779982452866,"responseId":"06679375328920864c0752153f7808ce"}}
